{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou classify queries as Positive, Negative, or Neutral.\nRefer to the provided examples. Examine each before deciding.\nHere are the examples:\nFantastic experience, will come again! [Positive]\nI wouldn't recommend this to anyone. [Negative]\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"What is the weather like today?"}],"temperature":0,"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"correct_answer":{"type":"string","enum":["Positive","Negative","Neutral"]}},"required":["correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}